  "title": "Hollister Launches Soccer-Inspired Capsule Collection",
  "summary": "Hollister is kicking off the summer soccer season with the launch of a new capsule collection in partnership with Italian sportswear brand, Kappa. The 22-piece collaboration blends Kappa’s European sport heritage with Hollister’s fashion-first aesthetic, resulting in a collection designed for match days, watch parties and everyday wear. The collection captures the growing intersection of sport, fashion and culture, ahead.",
